Greetings,

 I recently found out the hard way that my YDL doesn't support the ATTO
ExpressPCIProUL*3*D SCSI card, even though it supports the *2*D card
(which is running beautifully in one of my machines). This is a bummer for
me because I just bought 3 of these cards which I will now replace with
the 2D cards (I need these machines running yesterday :-( ).

 So that someone else doesn't get into the same situation as me, I am
willing to loan a card to anyone who might be able/willing to write a
driver for it.

 Anyone interested? If so, please let me know via private email.

